WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.479
After each run, the best
matches come to Telegram.

2
00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:08.140
A summary first, then one card per job:
rank, pay, title, company, city.

3
00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:12.296
Tap interested, ignore,
tailor your resume, or save it.

4
00:00:12.296 --> 00:00:14.165
Your board updates on the spot.

5
00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:17.688
It also nudges you when
an application goes quiet,

6
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:19.745
and warns you when a source breaks.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Quiet hours hold job pushes overnight.
The right jobs find you.
